id: pm-62n4kk
title: "GH-828: init status registries must expose one coherent alias contract"
description: "Fresh trackers embed status aliases in settings.json and write schema/statuses.json, but the two generated registries disagree specifically on the in_progress alias."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: "area:init","area:schema",github-intake,integrity
created_at: "2026-07-30T11:28:54.704Z"
